	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Valde miror te tanto tempore nihil plane <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ad nos scribere; intra 3. septembris nihil tuarum vidi <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>literarum, atque utinam recte valeas, non i<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>mpediaris morbo aliquo.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Res nostrae satis sunt <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>tranquillae per dei gratiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Fama de expeditione <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><placeName ref="l2478">Sabaudi</placeName> et prinicpum contra <placeName ref="l41">Bernates</placeName> nonnihil <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>deferbuit, ac scribitur ex <placeName ref="l41">Berna</placeName> milites in <lb xml:id="p1z8"/><placeName ref="l736">Pedemonte</placeName> conscriptos et milites <placeName ref="l301">Lugduni</placeName> collectos <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>iam movisse in <placeName ref="l2524">Scotiam</placeName> et contra <placeName ref="l830">Anglos</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Vigilant tamen nihilominus et stant omnes in pro<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>cinctu martis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Expectamus, quid allatura sint <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nobis proxima comitia, quae incipient ipsis <lb xml:id="p1z13"/><placeName>Baptistae</placeName> feriis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Interea sparguntur rumores <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><placeName ref="l646">Claronenses</placeName> brevi a <placeName ref="l2448">5 Pagicis</placeName> de improviso ad<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>obruendos et adigendos ad papatum.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Multi putant <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>hunc timorem esse vanum, maxime quod proximis <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>comitiis diserte ab omnibus Helvetiorum legatis <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>iniunctum est serio <placeName ref="l2448">5 Pagicis</placeName>, ne quid vi, sed <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>iure tantum tentent.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Si ergo contra ius aliquid <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tentarent, sciunt, quantus per totam <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiam</placeName> exoriretur <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>tumultus; putant ergo se non exposituros tanto per<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>iculo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ego vero, quid iudicem, nescio; hoc <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>tantum moneo, si audieris motum aliquem exoriri, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>tuos sedulo officii moneas, ut illis, qui in bello <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Mussico ipsis auxilium tulere, gratos se exhibeant <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>intelligantque hoc negotium a <placeName ref="l646">Claronensibus</placeName> incipi, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>finiendum autem esse in <placeName ref="l648">Rhetis</placeName> et aliis evangelio cre<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>dentibus.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Hortor ergo te, ut sapias et tuum hic facias <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>officium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Spero tamen illos nihil tenta<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>turos; praemoneo tamen, ut cogites apud te, quid <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>factu opus sit, si aliquid exoriretur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Dominus pacem <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>nobis concedat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Haec tibi soli servabis, donec aliquid <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>exortum fuerit; cum fidis nihilominus conferre poteris<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>,</foreign> ob sich ettwas zuͦtrüge, wie man dann sich schicken <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>möchte umb hilff geträngten zuͦ thuͦn, und umb das <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>üwer land wider den überfal ouch versähen.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Multis <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>enim oculis opus est, inprimis poenitentia, fide et <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>oratione.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Audimus classem <placeName ref="l875">Hispanicam</placeName> a <placeName ref="l2510">Turcis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>ad tripolim esse deletam et... sibi <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>quod... obtinere iam... navibus <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Sed certiora de his a te audire volo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">In <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>dicitur cessasse persequtio et vincti dimissi sunt; terruit <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>enim <placeName ref="l2524">Scotia</placeName> etc.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">In <placeName ref="l791">Valesia</placeName> crescit cognitio Christi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName>Gomsenses</placeName> (ist ein zenden, heyst Goms) <foreign xml:lang="la">voluerunt per tu<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>multum se opponere pietati,</foreign> habend mitt der matzen <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>wöllen uff sin.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de">Doch habend die andern zenden mitt inen <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>geredt so vil, das sy still gesässen sind etc.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Cras apud <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>nos novus creabitur consul.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Dominus misereatur nostri et <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>benedicat nobis etc.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Mei omnes te salutant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Audimus <lb xml:id="p2z10"/><persName ref="p629">Coignetum</persName> venturum ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> ad comitia <placeName ref="l21">Badensia</placeName>; <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>iam enim huc scripsit.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta d. <persName ref="p8359">Philippum</persName>, d. d. <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>consules et omnes amicos, inprimis d. legatum <placeName>Gallicum</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>celerrime 14. iunii 1560.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Ohne Adresse.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
